.TH smi-password-gen "1" "June 2026" "SMI Toolset" "SMI Password Generation Command"
.SH NAME
smi-password-gen \- Generate a random password
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B smi-password-gen
[
.I LENGTH
]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
.B smi-password-gen
generates a random password of a specified length. If no length is provided, it defaults to 21 characters.
The generated password contains uppercase letters, lowercase letters, digits, and several special characters.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I LENGTH
The length of the password to be generated. Must be a positive integer.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Password generated successfully.
.TP
.B 1
Invalid argument: LENGTH is not a positive integer, or too many arguments were supplied.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Generate a default length password (21 characters):
.IP
smi-password-gen
.PP
Generate a 32 character password:
.IP
smi-password-gen 32
.SH AUTHOR
.PP
Command originally based on password-generator.sh.
Renamed and updated by Junie.
.SH "REPORTING BUGS"
.PP
Report smi-password-gen bugs to \fIinfo@setmy.info\fR
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.PP
.BR smi-diskless-passwd (1)
